<h2 style=3D"margin:0; font-size:18px; line-height:150%"><span style=3D"fon=
t-size: 22px;">Dance makes it to the major leagues&nbsp;</span></h2>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Dance majors rejoice: You can finally call yo=
ur dad and tell him that his dreams are "wildly impractical and upsetting g=
randma."<br><br></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">A professional dance league is launching soon=
, and a new career path is coming with it.<br><br></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">The founders of <a href=3D"https://media.hubs=
pot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VVx4V93T8twjW1gsDJ34R25QcW5SJqyG5G31SfN6L2Z=
qz2-ZW0W50kgx26lZ3nkW45-PhH60_5zWN1mLjHTHmjtMW5Plp2R39CdX-W4v1QpT33jWD5W1nV=
zw21mVmjPN5SXx81K2kw_W1JfcqB1jyw1pW8Z9nnw7L-jMHW1KZCC_6tD1bbW5xXfls3pyw9vW6=
GVW2f6HKbM-VCLhHj7bHPdXW2BDTW24T45GTW6B8mKD7wPqVNW57wp3x85F2hhW7QByfR2NR1j8=
f2PZlCj04" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=
=3D"uDVfX61/" target=3D"_blank">STEEZY</a>, an online dance class platform,=
 closed a $7m seed round to start <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/=
Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VVx4V93T8twjW1gsDJ34R25QcW5SJqyG5G31SfN6L2Zqz2-ZW0W50kg=
x26lZ3nHW9gWK7k23YGtkW61CDdT1bGVMWW81yQNP8HmdRZW8F7kxJ8J0Bg3TpJT-6X53TqW3jV=
S6K8NH0jlW6WHFHx2JnpS4VjX53Z3PKp4tW8nJCHb5lJMtnW5JrMTb8q04zWW7JqHK-5X1xRbW1=
J5Bz01JqYjlN8c0HrfVDxcYW8LdpKC8phtWsW6WzNy49bBCmbW3YFNxZ4zqqX1f5V6pRH04" st=
yle=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"23zVhIfr"=
 target=3D"_blank">the International Dance League (IDL)</a>, a professional=
 association for dancing as a sport.&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%; font-weight:normal"><strong>Here's how it'll =
work:</strong></p>
<ul style=3D"line-height:150%">
<li aria-level=3D"1">The league will start with <a href=3D"https://media.hu=
bspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VVx4V93T8twjW1gsDJ34R25QcW5SJqyG5G31SfN6L=
2ZsF2-ZW0W95jsWP6lZ3n0W9cCTf934LNq8W3v9C0q3wxT3wW12FHJZ2qH4ChW2Rk7Wg2GMcNKV=
MDWXc5nh7LhW3r5hMr12Csj0W3XWQ3h13YVpQW38TMpx1r1pcdW6cpSc41Sd_4yW7cDdG36pZSk=
bW8mLndf4zGqBvW9kQXlP1S2d7vW906p761CmjPZW4wd64Z5WJMc7N3zfhDdC4PXvW7DQXrv6j4=
t-zW1kQG3h9c4xDMW5Js-jL7-6JPyW1Y7KZw3d9RR_VZQxBd7Vb2r7W6Pdlvf3K_0YZVGdCGx8t=
CRQHW3pnt8Z44S4L5N5dN8Tv_81PJW7YJtbd96CtbjW8cf84l2ZXgfTW5Yrw5T2Mf4Q8W2gqZ0Y=
2MshhmN2nRZCSVsC4XW3W_QmB2D-X0gf7pVQTM04" rel=3D"noopener" style=3D"color:#=
192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"hcStKraB" target=3D"_bl=
ank">six</a> teams, representing cities across four continents.&nbsp;<br><b=
r></li>
<li aria-level=3D"1">Teams will operate like NBA franchises with contracts,=
 salaries, seasons, and rivalries.<br><br></li>
<li aria-level=3D"1">IDL events will be full-blown spectacles with professi=
onal judges, DJs, halftime shows, and smaller showcases for local dance tro=
upes.</li>
</ul>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Dance is a notoriously unreliable line of wor=
k =E2=80=94 even the first dancers depicted in 9k-year-old cave paintings p=
robably had reservations about pursuing a career in it over hunting or gath=
ering.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">The IDL is trying to challenge that by establ=
ishing a clearer career trajectory for dancers.&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Sports leagues usually have some kind of tale=
nt development pipeline (Little League to college to minors to pros). Dance=
 doesn't.&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">That makes the IDL an interesting case study:=
 a sport being built in reverse, starting with a professional league and fi=
guring out talent-sourcing as it goes.&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%; font-weight:normal"><strong>What's in it for =
investors?</strong></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Though the IDL is still hashing out player de=
velopment, dance has an established audience. The league's big draws are th=
at base of interested spectators and its potential for virality.&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">STEEZY's network of instructors has 150m+ fol=
lowers, and dance content often performs well on TikTok (if you didn't know=
).&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Still, the IDL faces unique challenges. Other=
 professional leagues have successfully capitalized on viral trends and act=
ivities, like the <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-V=
f04/VVx4V93T8twjW1gsDJ34R25QcW5SJqyG5G31SfN6L2Zqz2-ZW0W50kgx26lZ3ppW8SStR88=
ZR0t8W3rdgnd4XN-gKW5z2Bqh88_qy6W6yV-K-3d2Y1mW17dB75567hjrW2qC81b777XdqW6D6Q=
bQ9dqgBGW5hc3pv8sZGHHW8dLnrR18Z2LDW7Y5n044l8XTJW5DwsJs1M3lBTN3qnyNwsCPl6W5k=
03S68qjwrBW4L4S9r5HtVDHW2zNc3d30hzk_W8jg6Ty36LCh4f751Pd804" style=3D"color:=
#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"2j6bX94j" target=3D"_b=
lank">PPA Tour</a> for pickleball and the <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.=
com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VVx4V93T8twjW1gsDJ34R25QcW5SJqyG5G31SfN6L2Zqz2-=
ZW0W50kgx26lZ3mwW94Qd_K2-nPK9M452cmpbSrtW2PWmTg80VtqrVSCd5f4NHtgBW781qQW2t4=
R9kW59wGHZ6JXjGGN3YwSZjyDKWCVVwmsV2twfVpW4w44Q_5SXy_qV6ptJ38RT5SnW5Qy2GG6c2=
2PrW1q4sPK5l08JDW6mc1L36H_01NW3HzFBT85whPfW6-bb677yTch_W87nqdc6K2G3Cf99KT2x=
04" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"ZcM=
FLeT0" target=3D"_blank">ACL</a> for cornhole.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">But they didn't have to standardize rules for=
 an artistic medium, promote teams across multiple continents, and build a =
talent development pipeline =E2=80=94 tall asks, but if the IDL pulls them =
off, it could make dance careers more viable and inspire more dreamers to p=
ursue them.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%; text-align:right" align=3D"right"><a href=3D"=
https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VVx4V93T8twjW1gsDJ34R25Qc=
W5SJqyG5G31SfN6L2Zr82-ZW0W69sMD-6lZ3l1W26lWvx6nMGs_V2g6WC1h3Rx1W3n2bTm6Pfxc=
4N7hFtTgKNmDLW6MxTsz8DMdqNW5v1cqG47t8NFW4nb7rb8dGzSLW4KtTW81kKKfqW1FZ4Lc5sH=
b82W1JKkvH8_Q-BbW4LXgv4752RvDW9kBNch4srBVKW1zj9YM33z6xZVnMg104nZQQYW6Hk0T-5=
GQ4NTW2FlMvx2gMrmVW5DCdTm1GbfwWW1f9ymK1GHQxfN4dpLY0QQZFRVVV0PS2K4-BMdwQ1CH0=
4" style=3D"color:#192733; text-decoration:none" rel=3D"noopener" data-hs-l=
