<p style=3D"line-height:150%"><br><span style=3D"font-weight: bold;">The el=
evator pitch: </span>=E2=80=9C=E2=80=98Hertility is rebuilding women=E2=80=
=99s healthcare so women don=E2=80=99t have to wait years for answers. We o=
ffer at-home hormone testing and direct access to specialist clinicians, so=
 you can go from confusion to clarity in days, not decades.=E2=80=9D</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%"><br><span style=3D"font-weight: bold;">The pr=
oblem they=E2=80=99re solving: </span>=E2=80=9CWomen spend an average of ei=
ght years getting diagnosed with a hormone or reproductive health condition=
 because the healthcare system still treats periods, pain, fertility, and m=
enopause like a =E2=80=98rare disease.=E2=80=99=E2=80=9D&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%"><br><span style=3D"font-weight: bold;">One tr=
uly innovative thing they=E2=80=99re doing: </span>=E2=80=9CWe=E2=80=99re b=
uilding a first-of-its-kind hormone health dataset across the reproductive =
lifespan, not just fertility. It=E2=80=99s letting us spot patterns in cond=
itions like PCOS, endometriosis, perimenopause, and ovarian aging years ear=
lier than traditional pathways.=E2=80=9D<br><br></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%"><span style=3D"font-weight: bold;">Advice to =
a fellow entrepreneur: </span>=E2=80=9CThe customer is the only one who liv=
es the problem. Everyone else is just commentating from the sidelines.=E2=
=80=9D</p>
