reneurship advice that=E2=80=99s BS:</span> =E2=80=9C=E2=80=98Move fast and=
 break things.=E2=80=99 In healthcare, if you break things, you break peopl=
e. Speed is great. Sloppiness can be lethal.=E2=80=9D<br><br></p>
